91
00:04:04,424 --> 00:04:06,765
Now if we have even more arguments, let's

92
00:04:06,765 --> 00:04:10,485
say 3 arguments, then we reach the point

93
00:04:10,918 --> 00:04:14,012
where it's very hard to justify why we need

94
00:04:14,108 --> 00:04:15,135
that many arguments.

95
00:04:16,145 --> 00:04:18,678
For example, if we have a calc function

96
00:04:19,015 --> 00:04:22,110
which calculates something, we might take in

97
00:04:22,222 --> 00:04:24,467
the 2 numbers which we want to use in the

98
00:04:24,467 --> 00:04:27,000
calculation, and then we have a 3rd

99
00:04:27,032 --> 00:04:29,486
parameter which defines which kind of

100
00:04:29,582 --> 00:04:31,201
calculation we want to perform.

101
00:04:31,907 --> 00:04:34,167
And this is challenging to understand and

102
00:04:34,167 --> 00:04:35,161
