108
00:04:49,395 --> 00:04:51,415
But especially when we call this, it's also

109
00:04:51,463 --> 00:04:54,413
hard to understand because the order is

110
00:04:54,605 --> 00:04:55,856
totally not obvious.

111
00:04:56,833 --> 00:05:00,023
We will probably need to dive into the code

112
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,168
or

113
00:05:00,697 --> 00:05:04,688
use some IDE features to understand which

114
00:05:04,768 --> 00:05:05,939
