115
00:05:06,868 --> 00:05:09,321
For example, the type of calculation,

116
00:05:09,898 --> 00:05:12,799
add in this example, could also be the first

117
00:05:12,864 --> 00:05:15,557
argument. Common sense doesn't tell us

118
00:05:15,605 --> 00:05:17,512
