119
00:05:17,512 --> 00:05:19,388
argument because this is not a common

120
00:05:19,452 --> 00:05:22,017
function, not a common thing, unlike the

121
00:05:22,017 --> 00:05:22,289
point.

122
00:05:22,979 --> 00:05:25,287
So therefore, you wanna avoid functions like

123
00:05:25,287 --> 00:05:26,890
this if possible.

124
00:05:27,772 --> 00:05:30,978
There can always be scenarios where you need

125
00:05:30,978 --> 00:05:33,206
a function like this, but you will probably

126
00:05:33,254 --> 00:05:35,979
